text Ask "make me a calculator"
text Reply "Model supplied answer."
fn askload to void
put Inlen 0 len Ask
for i ulong len Ask
put In i get Ask i
end
end
fn main to int
askload
check start 2 0 1
check eq get R 1 1 2
check eq get R 2 2 3
check eq get R 8 len Ack 4
old = get R 0
check not start 1 1 5
put Inlen 0 len Reply
for i ulong len Reply
put In i get Reply i
end
check not answer add old 1 2 6
check eq get R 8 len Ack 7
check answer old 3 8
check eq get R 1 0 9
askload
check start 1 4 10
check gt get R 0 old 11
cancel
check eq get R 1 0 12
check not answer get R 0 5 13
askload
check start 1 10 14
check eq tick 20009 0 15
check eq tick 20010 1 16
check eq tick 20011 0 17
check eq tick 30010 2 18
check eq get R 1 0 19
old = get R 0
reset
check eq get R 0 old 20
askload
check start 2 40000 21
check gt get R 0 old 22
cancel
put Inlen 0 160
check not start 1 40001 23
check eq get R 1 0 24
askload
check not start 3 40002 25
put R 6 1
check start 3 40003 26
check eq get R 8 len Ackmore 27
cancel
put R 0 4294967295
check not start 1 40004 28
ret int get Fails 0
end
